// The voices this project can narrate in.
//
// Paste an ElevenLabs voice ID and give it a name you will recognise in the
// dropdown. The name is yours: write whatever tells you apart from the others,
// including the language, because the ID on its own says nothing.
//
// IDs come from elevenlabs.io: open Voices, pick one, and copy its ID. Any
// voice on your account works, your own cloned ones included.
//
// A voice designed on one model sounds different on another. Add "model" to
// pin it: that voice is then always read by that model, and the Model setting
// only applies to voices without one. The models are eleven_v3,
// eleven_multilingual_v2, eleven_turbo_v2_5 and eleven_flash_v2_5.
//
//   { "id": "...", "name": "Roland", "model": "eleven_v3" }
//
// Changing voice regenerates every line, at ElevenLabs' usual cost. The cache
// is keyed on the voice, so switching back to one you already used is free.
[
  {
    "id": "21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM",
    "name": "Rachel (English, calm)"
  },
  {
    "id": "h6uBOiAjLKklte8hdYio",
    "name": "Roland"
  },
  {
    "id": "0qLmDzgqulxcvv0yf3kg",
    "name": "Remko"
  },
  {
    "id": "lyMhRNSScIYS9YRQitfK",
    "name": "Reclame man"
  }
]
